Json Streaming ([jsonl][jsonl-format] / [x-ndjson][x-ndjson]) content type can be used to stream content from certain operations. These operations expose a stream that can used for consuming the events in Java. The events will terminate when the server no longer has any events to send and closes the underlying connection.

